"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[1804],{51804:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"tarify-gaz-elektrichestvo-oktyabr-2026","locale":"en","title":"Gas rises 9.6% and household electricity 11.3% from October 1, 2026","description":"Household electricity rose 11.3% and gas 9.6% from October 1, 2026. What makes up the bill, the ruble impact and what happens in July 2027.","blocks":[{"id":"b001","kind":"paragraph","text":"Gas and electricity became more expensive in Russia from October 1, 2026. Gazprom\'s wholesale gas price rose by 9.6%. Household electricity prices rose by 11.3% for homes consuming up to 3900 kWh per month. Household gas and electricity prices are set by the state rather than the market, on a schedule and by a percentage included in the government forecast. Such prices are regulated. The 2026 increase was therefore already visible in the government\'s economic forecast a year earlier."},{"id":"b002","kind":"paragraph","text":"A gas bill has three components. Gas itself accounts for 80%, delivery through pipes to the home for 15%, and billing-company services for 5%. Each component increased separately from October 1: gas by 9.6%, delivery by 11.6% and services by 5.1%. Together, the bill rises by about 9.7% (0.8 \xd7 9.6 + 0.15 \xd7 11.6 + 0.05 \xd7 5.1)."},{"id":"b003","kind":"paragraph","text":"Electricity follows the same logic: a household\'s price combines the energy itself and delivery through wires. Main transmission networks raised tariffs by 16%, and local distribution networks by 15.2%. The final household price increased by less, 11.3%. Delivery rose sharply but represents only part of the bill."},{"id":"b004","kind":"paragraph","text":"In rubles, each 1000 rubles a family previously paid for electricity now carries an extra 113 rubles; gas adds about 97 rubles. In Moscow, a kWh for an apartment with a gas stove rose from 8 to 8.9 rubles. An apartment using 200 kWh a month now pays 1780 rubles rather than 1600, an extra 180. Local authorities approve household tariffs within limits set by the Federal Antimonopoly Service."},{"id":"b005","kind":"paragraph","text":"October\'s increase is not the last. From July 1, 2027, gas will rise another 10.4%, rather than the previously planned 9.1%. Two successive indexations will raise wholesale gas prices by about 21% over 9 months (1.096 \xd7 1.104). Household distribution-network tariffs will increase by 17.5% in July 2027. Tariffs normally change in July, and this schedule resumes from 2027."},{"id":"b006","kind":"paragraph","text":"For an ordinary household, meters, efficient lamps and insulation pay back faster where bills are large, such as a detached home with electric heating. In a small apartment, those expenses take longer to recover. The July 2027 increase can already be included in the family budget, although its percentage has already changed once."},{"id":"b007","kind":"heading","text":"How much did gas prices rise from October 1, 2026?"},{"id":"b008","kind":"paragraph","text":"Wholesale gas rose by 9.6%, distribution-network delivery by 11.6%, and gas-company services by 5.1%. Together, the bill rises by about 9.7%."},{"id":"b009","kind":"heading","text":"How much did electricity prices rise from October 1, 2026?"},{"id":"b010","kind":"paragraph","text":"Household prices increased by 11.3% for consumption up to 3900 kWh per month. Network tariffs rose by more, 15.2–16%."},{"id":"b011","kind":"heading","text":"When is the next gas and electricity tariff increase?"},{"id":"b012","kind":"paragraph","text":"From July 1, 2027. Gas will rise by 10.4% and household distribution-network tariffs by 17.5%; the latter is only one part of the electricity price."}],"sources":[{"label":"Gazprom\'s regulated gas prices are indexed by 9.6%","url":"https://www.interfax.ru/business/1119546"},{"label":"Federal Antimonopoly Service to index natural-gas tariffs by 9.6% from October 1","url":"https://www.garant.ru/news/1947004/"},{"label":"Russian electricity network tariffs rise 15.2% from October; unified grid tariff rises 16%","url":"https://www.interfax.ru/russia/1119539"},{"label":"Federal Antimonopoly Service to inspect regional electricity tariffs","url":"https://www.kommersant.ru/doc/8990884"},{"label":"Moscow electricity tariffs in 2026","url":"https://t-j.ru/msk-electroprices/"},{"label":"Moscow electricity tariffs 2026","url":"https://www.vesti.ru/vj/tarify-na-ehlektroehnergiyu-v-moskve"}],"sourceBodySha256":"b809a176f95ae120cd852b989f922de8a276fc4ea55fc40cff70d0caebfcadd4"}')}}]);